":"This is split off of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121910\r\n\r\nWhile working on that PR, I noticed a number of minor issues in the OpenGL renderer which are fixed here:\r\n\r\n- In `render_target_create`: it wasn't setting `RenderTarget::self` and the pointer on `Texture::render_target` was incorrect (it was a pointer to a struct on the stack, not the struct in `render_target_owner`)\r\n- When binding `TEXTURE_2D_ARRAY` (as is used in stereo rendering) we were incorrectly attempting to unbind by using `TEXTURE_2D` instead\r\n- When clearing overrides in `render_target_set_override()`, we were clearing the render target twice, and never resetting the `is_overridden` flag. Also, `rt->texture` was getting set for no reason - when using overrides, we always pull it from `rt->overridden.color` - setting `rt->texture` just dillutes the meaning of that member (it should just contain non-overrides)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122271/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"